Pre-PR: same code except `turnStartLine: outputLines.length - echoCut` was set (using accumulated cut) — and stickyIndex/bootAnchorLine were ALSO not shifted pre-PR in this path. So the sticky/boot shift omission is PRE-EXISTING in `_steerAll` (not a regression by this PR).

